                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1a90d4e-c5de-495a-b31d-0c0357dfae1b",
                        "source_entry_id": "152887bc-10c3-351f-8831-30b51940d78a",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a4f00a8-8550-3b49-8f1b-e8461be5812b",
                        "source_sense_description": "meist Singular: solidarisches Verhalten in einer nichtverwandten Gruppe oder Gemeinschaft",
                        "target_lang_word": "fraternity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fraternity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4824c529-73c4-3923-804d-c441f35b19dc",
                                        "entry_id": "e072158b-7cff-3e8f-8c01-923330b7d773",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being brothers or brotherly; brotherhood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bec91b8-6ea5-3f8b-a488-d3ab4b723056",
                                        "entry_id": "e072158b-7cff-3e8f-8c01-923330b7d773",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of people associated for a common purpose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c62ae6b-7d51-4608-b8a6-21c7772697a6",
                                                "sense_id": "9bec91b8-6ea5-3f8b-a488-d3ab4b723056",
                                                "text": "Having now so amply declared unto thee most of the principal things of this thrice-renowned and illustrious city, I will briefly by way of an epitome mention most of the other particulars thereof, and so finally shut up this narration: there are reported to be in Venice and the circumjacent islands two hundred churches in which are one hundred forth-three pairs of organs, fifty-four monasteries, twenty-six nunneries, fifty-six tribunals or places of judgment, seventeen hospitals, six companies or fraternities, whereof I have before spoken; one hundred and sixty-five marble statues of worthy personages, partly equestrial, partly pedestrial, which are erected in sundry places of the city, to the honour of those that either at home have prudently administered the commonweal, or abroad valiantly fought for the same."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b69f25e3-e3bb-49d3-9c4d-000fa67f16d8",
                                                "sense_id": "9bec91b8-6ea5-3f8b-a488-d3ab4b723056",
                                                "text": "The decision of Judge Stafford [to dismiss the case] represents an exhibition of raw power wielded by the well-organized fraternities of the medical profession against consumer groups working in the interest of women's health care."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2353f331-faca-3b31-bfef-56d248f57580",
                                        "entry_id": "e072158b-7cff-3e8f-8c01-923330b7d773",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A social organization of male students at a college or university; usually identified by Greek letters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Philippines",
                                            "US",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad5cb6c2-b336-4a23-a7c5-491f304b59b6",
                                                "sense_id": "2353f331-faca-3b31-bfef-56d248f57580",
                                                "text": "Colin Schlank said he rushed a fraternity because he wanted to expand his social circle. […] “They’re called social fraternities for a reason,” he said, “because you’re trying to branch out, you’re trying to meet new people.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb80c0a2-39e3-42dd-addd-3e8aa59d5900",
                        "source_entry_id": "152887bc-10c3-351f-8831-30b51940d78a",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a4f00a8-8550-3b49-8f1b-e8461be5812b",
                        "source_sense_description": "meist Singular: solidarisches Verhalten in einer nichtverwandten Gruppe oder Gemeinschaft",
                        "target_lang_word": "brotherhood",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "brotherhood",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38f36747-c06d-3f31-a456-4bf4c2cc35d0",
                                        "entry_id": "f81f9333-9d15-32e0-bcd3-d4d3dca605a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being brothers or a brother (also figuratively)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3d55458-53da-4280-8893-eda0a4919f0a",
                                                "sense_id": "38f36747-c06d-3f31-a456-4bf4c2cc35d0",
                                                "text": "brotherdom"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d470359b-f31c-43c2-849d-01aabcf47fc2",
                                                "sense_id": "38f36747-c06d-3f31-a456-4bf4c2cc35d0",
                                                "text": "\"Read lips: Without gas or without you? Without you. Without light or without you? Without you. Without water or without you? Without you. Without food or without you? Without you.\n\"Cold, hunger, darkness and thirst are not as terrible and deadly for us as your \"friendship and brotherhood.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e2df012-9f5c-3eea-b1b0-e02bfb2f0607",
                                        "entry_id": "f81f9333-9d15-32e0-bcd3-d4d3dca605a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An association of people for any purpose, such as a society of monks; a fraternity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a7ab05f-422f-4dd5-ba2d-d26c08ce41f8",
                                                "sense_id": "5e2df012-9f5c-3eea-b1b0-e02bfb2f0607",
                                                "text": "James formed a kind of brotherhood for ex-pats who were working in Valencia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eff0241f-885b-3a83-8417-5f5af87533ce",
                                        "entry_id": "f81f9333-9d15-32e0-bcd3-d4d3dca605a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "All the people engaged in the same business, especially those of the same profession"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5555c5a-6846-453e-b0cc-34b900935db6",
                                                "sense_id": "eff0241f-885b-3a83-8417-5f5af87533ce",
                                                "text": "the legal brotherhood"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "932955f5-7e17-4255-a6e0-79282d72bb1c",
                                                "sense_id": "eff0241f-885b-3a83-8417-5f5af87533ce",
                                                "text": "the medical brotherhood"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e69bb1f-6c69-3beb-a1e1-2240d9a30e05",
                                        "entry_id": "f81f9333-9d15-32e0-bcd3-d4d3dca605a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "People, or (poetically) things, of the same kind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cdc0c76-f113-44a2-bf58-1f696946ddcd",
                                                "sense_id": "1e69bb1f-6c69-3beb-a1e1-2240d9a30e05",
                                                "text": "a brotherhood of venerable trees"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "638eb9ca-39e4-4168-9b4b-6ac2cf2b2e30",
                        "source_entry_id": "152887bc-10c3-351f-8831-30b51940d78a",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a4f00a8-8550-3b49-8f1b-e8461be5812b",
                        "source_sense_description": "meist Singular: solidarisches Verhalten in einer nichtverwandten Gruppe oder Gemeinschaft",
                        "target_lang_word": "fraternité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fraternité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89e901fb-1fc2-3a63-9cc6-e532156673c3",
                                        "entry_id": "a48fc804-4999-31dd-8c8a-d238bcc64b9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lien de parenté qui unit les enfants, frères et sœurs, nés des mêmes parents."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5355f4b3-3314-4eaa-9fe9-c14c4ae49592",
                                                "sense_id": "89e901fb-1fc2-3a63-9cc6-e532156673c3",
                                                "text": "La seule notion de fraternité qui m'intéressait était celle à laquelle j'avais parfois recours lorsque je séchais sur un devoir. À ce moment, un grand frère ne m'aurait pas déplu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9ae01ea-c652-331f-9c2c-2930e959102a",
                                        "entry_id": "a48fc804-4999-31dd-8c8a-d238bcc64b9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Idée selon laquelle tous les humains, hommes et femmes, sont égaux et méritent égale dignité et égale considération."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6895ef05-191c-440e-a362-bce242c177d5",
                                                "sense_id": "e9ae01ea-c652-331f-9c2c-2930e959102a",
                                                "text": "La constitution de 1793 fut le premier pacte social qui, depuis l'origine du monde, eût fait un dogme de la fraternité humaine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8df26d0b-0d09-4ce5-96c6-569388c49600",
                                                "sense_id": "e9ae01ea-c652-331f-9c2c-2930e959102a",
                                                "text": "Quand nous reconnaissons en l'autre quelques chose qui nous est commun, cela s'appelle la fraternité. Cela s'appelle l'humanité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dde82250-75c4-435a-9bef-4da5e72c53d4",
                                                "sense_id": "e9ae01ea-c652-331f-9c2c-2930e959102a",
                                                "text": "La notion de fraternité est éminemment paradoxale, car elle dit le lien avec un terme excluant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea63620f-b1c0-3ceb-8284-282b7c95a308",
                                        "entry_id": "a48fc804-4999-31dd-8c8a-d238bcc64b9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Liaison étroite que contractent ensemble ceux qui, sans être frères, se traitent néanmoins comme des frères."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8a76485-be4a-4144-aa16-709bccccfc01",
                                                "sense_id": "ea63620f-b1c0-3ceb-8284-282b7c95a308",
                                                "text": "Il y a fraternité entre ces deux hommes, entre ces deux familles, entre ces deux républiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4708cac-ebc6-4f18-91e3-5651c13845c1",
                                                "sense_id": "ea63620f-b1c0-3ceb-8284-282b7c95a308",
                                                "text": "Toutefois, si un magnanime sentiment de fraternité s'imposait sincèrement et définitivement, sans arrière pensée, à tous les esprits européens, alors nous n'aurions pas à nous inquiéter du cosmopolitisme marseillais, intéressant embryon de la civilisation future."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28735faa-ba5f-3a1e-a3ca-1d91013d2c80",
                                        "entry_id": "a48fc804-4999-31dd-8c8a-d238bcc64b9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Organisme, association, à caractère religieux, entre personnes voulant vivre de façon fraternelle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6a75782-a564-47d9-bc3d-33771c55f5db",
                                                "sense_id": "28735faa-ba5f-3a1e-a3ca-1d91013d2c80",
                                                "text": "En termes d’insertion ecclésiale, ils ont tous, à un moment ou à un autre, étudié dans des pensions privées hors contrat tenues par des prêtres de la Fraternité Saint Pie X, fraternité schismatique d’avec l’Église, fondée par Monseigneur Lefebvre suite à la « crise catholique » (PEL-LETIER, 2002) postconciliaire, ou par la Fraternité Saint Pierre fondée par des membres issus de la précédente fraternité, mais qui sont revenus dans le giron de l’Église catholique romaine, […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64bd01da-a164-3efd-add3-080ff4977651",
                                        "entry_id": "a48fc804-4999-31dd-8c8a-d238bcc64b9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Société d'étudiants organisée au sein des universités d'Amérique du Nord."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba402406-b173-46ca-b8e5-ae80d20c6970",
                                                "sense_id": "64bd01da-a164-3efd-add3-080ff4977651",
                                                "text": "Pourquoi s’était-il ainsi ligoté, un dimanche soir à l’heure paisible et creuse où les garçons, dans les fraternités, les maisons de bois clair et de briques rouges posées sur les collines et dans les vallons, mangeaient le poulet frit au riz brun en écoutant Mitch Miller et ses chœurs chanter Barney Google ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
